	| External ID      | User1                            |
	And I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk Agent1                    |
	| Password         | ${staticZendeskAdminPassword}     |
	| Role             | Agent                             |
	| Email            | zendesk.agent1@liferay.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                 |
	| Language         | English                           |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)        |
	| External ID      | Agent1                            |
	And I assign the user with the email address "zendesk.agent1@liferay.com.broken" to the group "CSE - US"
	When I create a request as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following values
	| Product                  | prd_liferay_dxp_7_4                              |
	| Component                | authentication                                   |
	| System Status            | production_functioning_with_limited_capabilities |
	| Subject                  | Request Subject                                  |
	| Description              | Request Description                              |
	| Organization External ID | 12345678                                         |
	And I assign the ticket with the ID "${staticRequestIdList}" to a user with the email address "zendesk.agent1@liferay.com.broken"
	Then an email regarding an assignment to ticketId "${staticRequestIdList}" for the support language "English" containing the following parameters should be sent out to the ticket assignee
